## Title: CreatureAffixes
## Version: 0.3.0
## Notes: Shows the realm's creature prefixes and affixes on the target frame and TidyPlates target/mouseover nameplates, and keeps the marker auras out of the aura bar. Needs the server's mod-creature-affixes; the hidden size layer is intentionally not shown.
